אוֹת</span> = 500 <a data-ref=\"Genesis 5:30\" href=\"/Genesis.5.30\">Gn 5:30</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 5:32\" href=\"/Genesis.5.32\">32</a> + 49 times + <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 42:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.42.16\">Ez 42:16</a> Qr"}], "num": "3."}, {"senses": [{"definition": "<span dir=\"rtl\">חֲמֵשֶׁת אֲלָפִים</span> = 5000 <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:32\" href=\"/Numbers.31.32\">Nu 31:32</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 8:12\" href=\"/Joshua.8.12\">Jos 8:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 20:45\" href=\"/Judges.20.45\">Ju 20:45</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.5\">1 S 17:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 45:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.45.6\">Ez 45:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 48:15\" href=\"/Ezekiel.48.15\">48:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 29:7\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.29.7\">1 Ch 29:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 35:9\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.35.9\">2 Ch 35:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 1:11\" href=\"/Ezra.1.11\">Ezr 1:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:69\" href=\"/Ezra.2.69\">2:69</a>;—in 25,000, 35,000 etc. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲמִשָּׁה</span> (usually without <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span>) precedes the 20,000, 30,000, etc."}], "num": "4."}, {"senses": [{"definition": "with other numerals:"}, {"senses": [{"definition": "<span dir=\"rtl\">חָמֵשׁ</span> before larger numeral: (1) noun repeated <a data-ref=\"Genesis 5:6\" href=\"/Genesis.5.6\">Gn 5:6</a> + 4 times; (2) noun with 2nd num. only, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 5:17\" href=\"/Genesis.5.17\">Gn 5:17</a> + 8 times + <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 45:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.45.3\">Ez 45:3</a> Kt; (3) noun c. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּ</span> with 2nd num. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:21\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.21\">Ez 40:21</a> + 2 times"}], "num": "a."}, {"senses": [{"definition": "<span dir=\"rtl\">חָמֵשׁ</span> after larger num.: (1) noun repeated <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:7\" href=\"/Genesis.25.7\">Gn 25:7</a>; (2) noun foll. <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> (only) <a data-ref=\"Judges 14:10\" href=\"/Judges.14.10\">Ju 14:10</a> + (especially in expressions of age and duration); (3) noun before both num., st. abs., <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 3:15\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.3.15\">2 Ch 3:15</a>; st. cstr. <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 15:19\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.15.19\">2 Ch 15:19</a>."}], "num": "b."}, {"senses": [{"definition": "no noun expr., <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> between other num., e.g. <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁשׁ מאות ח׳ ושׁבעים</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:37\" href=\"/Numbers.31.37\">Nu 31:37</a>."}], "num": "c."}, {"senses": [{"definition": "<span dir=\"rtl\">חֲמִשָּׁה</span> before larger num., noun foll. larger num. <a data-ref=\"Numbers 1:25\" href=\"/Numbers.1.25\">Nu 1:25</a> + 22 times"}], "num": "d."}, {"senses": [{"definition": "<span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> follows, and (1) is foll. by noun <a data-ref=\"Judges 20:35\" href=\"/Judges.20.35\">Ju 20:35</a> + 7 times; (2) noun precedes both <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:3\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.3\">1 K 7:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 52:30\" href=\"/Jeremiah.52.30\">Je 52:30</a>."}], "num": "e."}, {"senses": [{"definition": "<span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> precedes, no noun expr. <a data-ref=\"I Kings 5:12\" href=\"/I_Kings.5.12\">1 K 5:12</a>."}], "num": "f."}, {"senses": [{"definition": "<span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> follows, no noun expr. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 18:28\" href=\"/Genesis.18.28\">Gn 18:28</a> +."}], "num": "g."}, {"senses": [{"definition": "no noun expr. <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> between other num. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 38:28\" href=\"/Exodus.38.28\">Ex 38:28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:5\" href=\"/Ezra.2.5\">Ezr 2:5</a>."}], "num": "h."}], "num": "5."}]}, "rid": "BDB03226", "strong_numbers": ["2568"], "next_hw": "חֹ֫מֶשׁ", "prev_hw": "חמשׁ", "alt_headwords": [{"word": "חֲמִשָּׁה", "occurences": "342"}], "quotes": [], "GK": ["2822"], "TWOT": ["686a"], "parent_lexicon_details": {"name": "BDB Dictionary", "language": "heb.biblical", "to_language": "eng", "text_categories": [], "source": "BDB Dictionary", "attribution": "F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs", "index_title": "BDB", "version_title": "A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906", "version_lang": "en", "should_autocomplete": true}}, {"headword": "חָמֵשׁ", "parent_lexicon": "Ben Yehuda Dictionary", "content": {"definition": ["<p><sup class=\"footnote-marker\">2</sup><i class=\"footnote\">בערב' חַ'מִשׂ, חַ'מְשַׂה خَمس, خَمسَة.</i>, לנק', סמי' חֲמֵשׁ, לזכ' חֲמִשָּׁה, סמי' חֲמֵשֶׁת, מ\"ר חֲמִשִּׁים, — מספר אחת ואחת ואחת ואחת ואחת, fünf; cinq; five: חָמֵשׁ אמות ארך וְחָמֵשׁ אמות רחב <span class=\"by-source\">שמות כז א</span>.  כי זה שנתים הרעב בקרב הארץ ועוד חָמֵשׁ שנים אשר אין חריש וקציר <span class=\"by-source\">בראש' מה ו</span>.  ויחבר את חֲמֵשׁ הירעת אחת אל אחת <span class=\"by-source\">שמות לו י</span>.  חֲמֵשׁ עשרה שנה <span class=\"by-source\">בראש' ה י</span>.  וַחֲמֵשׁ מאת שנה <span class=\"by-source\">שם ל</span>.  חֲמֵשׁ מאות בַּחֲמֵשׁ מאות מרבע סביב <span class=\"by-source\">יחזק' מה ב</span>.  אחד נפש מֵחֲמֵשׁ המאות <span class=\"by-source\">במד' לא כח</span>. —  ולזכ' חֲמִשָּׁה: ומקצה אחיו לקח חֲמִשָּׁה אנשים <span class=\"by-source\">בראש' מז ב</span>.  ורדפו מכם חֲמִשָּׁה מאה <span class=\"by-source\">ויקר' כו ח</span>.  חֲמִשָּׁה עשר שקל <span class=\"by-source\">שם כז ז</span>.  ארבעה מלכים את הַחֲמִשָּׁה <span class=\"by-source\">בראש' יד ט</span>.  לא אשחית אם אמצא שם ארבעים וַחֲמִשָּׁה <span class=\"by-source\">שם יח כח</span>. בַּחֲמִשָּׁה עשר יום לחדש השני <span class=\"by-source\">שמות יו א</span>.  לַחֲמִשָּׁה עשר לירמות <span class=\"by-source\">דהי\"א כה כב</span>.  חֲמֵשֶׁת מלכי מדין <span class=\"by-source\">במדב' לא ח</span>.  ויאספו ויעלו חֲמֵשֶׁת מלכי האמרי <span class=\"by-source\">יהוש' י ה</span>.  וינסו חֲמֵשֶׁת המלכים האלה  <span class=\"by-source\">שם יו</span>.  ויעלו חֲמֵשֶׁת האנשים ההלכים לרגל את הארץ <span class=\"by-source\">שופט' יח יז</span>.  ויקח כַּחֲמֵשֶׁת אלפים איש <span class=\"by-source\">יהושע ח יב</span>.  לַחֲמֵשֶׁת הסרנים <span class=\"by-source\">ש\"א ו יח</span>.  ולקחת חֲמֵשֶׁת חֲמֵשֶׁת שקלים לגלגלת <span class=\"by-source\">במדב' ג מז</span>.  — ומ\"ר חֲמִשִּׁים, עי' <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Ben_Yehuda_Dictionary,_חֲמִשִּׁים.1\" data-ref=\"Ben Yehuda Dictionary, חֲמִשִּׁים 1\">חֲמִשִּׁים</a>.  — °חֲמִשָּׁה עָלִים, עי' <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Ben_Yehuda_Dictionary,_חֲמִשָּׁה.1\" data-ref=\"Ben Yehuda Dictionary, חֲמִשָּׁה 1\">חֲמִשָּׁה</a>.  — °חָמֵשׁ!  סגולה מעין הרע וכדומה: פתח יד ואמור <strong>חמש</strong> <span class=\"by-source\">מנח' יהודה, שונא הנשים</span>.</p>"]}, "rid": "BY-06378", "prev_hw": "חמש", "next_hw": "חֹמֶשׁ I", "page_num": 1639, "parent_lexicon_details": {"name": "Ben Yehuda Dictionary", "language": "heb", "to_language": "heb", "text_categories": [], "index_title": "Ben Yehuda Dictionary", "version_title": "Ben Yehuda Dictionary", "version_lang": "he", "should_autocomplete": true}}]